e to  big Indian cities like Delhi and Mumbai  and some even go abroad to countries  like the U  we Afghanistan and Malaysia but shark  hunt isn't the only place where young  people are in trouble every year  millions join the workforce in India  according to unreleased government data  unemployment is at a 45 year high  critics say that while the governing BJP  is rhetoric has focused on nationalism  in this election it has been silent on  job creation  a coalition of youth groups called the  young India Rights Committee has come  together expressly to campaign against  the Modi government they say they will  support any candidates who stand against  the BJP and its policies on education  and employment several member groups are  left leaning this meeting is in support  of a candidate from the CPI ml a  communist parties have been very very  horrible for the youth of India there  has been a very dangerous structure  shift you know during Modi regime when  it comes to the youth and the students  of the country the youth is the future  of the country and they are not only  fighting for themselves those are  fighting for India where you know right  to education right to implement right to  health and rights of the citizen young  locals attending the meeting are just as  angry the government needs to ensure  that young people are provided with  secure jobs so they don't have to  struggle to earn their livelihoods I've  been looking for a government job for  three or four years but no luck yet and  being education a student I am also a  very upset from the government system  because government has lost the system  but they haven't know any people on how  to provide that this system to the  door-to-door to the rural areas a  student  even as night sets in the crowd listens  on with rapt attention the message here  is clear a vote against Modi is a vote  for their future
 

